{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的左栏长句缺少 X 的加亮关键词，快速扫读时不如 X 容易抓住核心，而且音乐声部、力度变化和细微情绪起伏的描写有所减少。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 把人物的动机、顾虑、心理变化和前后因果交代得更完整，观众即使没有读过原文，也比较容易理解他为什么从试探、期待走向坦白，又为什么在高兴时仍然害怕失去。X 的关键词突出，音乐细节和感官层次也更丰富，但部分段落的短词、意象和到时出现的提示过于密集，容易让观众忙于追踪碎片，反而削弱对人物整段经历的理解。综合实际观看体验，我选 Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4645c831-1c60-4a96-ba0d-882101b9e45e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T231939527295Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.937, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T23:20:46.483059+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "569be9b7b13e94377b8ed757e5b5283cf72640eea042837a98db445d9d3f9551", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_